<title>GERMANY: German grain traders apply for intvn rye export.</title>
<headline>German grain traders apply for intvn rye export.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>German grain traders bid for the export of 52,500 tonnes of intervention rye to third countries, state grain intervention board BLE said on Thursday.</p>
<p>No other bids for intervention grain were received.</p>
<p>-Hamburg newsroom, +49-40-41903275</p>
</text>
